<html><head><title></title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Welcome to the lower camp! Step inside and reflect on everything you have learned in the design process before moving on to the participation phase.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Find inspiration for reflection sessions below, while on the next page, you can contribute to our ongoing research for the further development of transdisciplinary education.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font color="#000000"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Campfire conversations: a reflection break in the TRAIL</span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">You have just completed an important phase. Take some time to look back and reflect with your group.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font color="#000000"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Sharing Circle</span></span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Share your experiences and feelings with each other in the open setting of a sharing circle: an open setting for all project participants to share their experiences and feelings with the group. For a productive and safe group conversation, it is important that a moderator is well-prepared and follows guidelines. You can find these guidelines in&nbsp;<a href="https://www.globallearningpartners.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Sharing-Circle-Guidelines.pdf">this article</a>.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-weight: bolder;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Discussion canvas of collaboration<o:p></o:p></font></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000">Use the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wijzijnkatapult.nl/files/downloads/Tools/Tool_3-Katapult_reflectie_tool_samenwerken%20v0.4.pdf">discussion canvas</a>&nbsp;from Katapult [in Dutch, English tool will follow soon] to reflect on the collaboration and determine which aspects of the collaboration need extra attention. Collaboration partners can first map out their own perspective on the collaboration, and subsequently bring these visions together to form a shared understanding of the collaboration.</font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," style="width: 1163px;" data-filename="Brighter Exterior.JPG"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size: 14pt; line-height: 21.6533px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></body></html>